{#- Record licences, keyed by the SPDX values of the form's License field
    (submission.license). Imported where needed:
      {% import "_partials/licenses.njk" as licenses %}
    A record with no licence uses station.defaultLicense, else `default`.
    open = content may be listed as open access (CLOCKSS manifest, rel=license).
    A value not listed here (free text) is shown as text and treated as not open.
    Kept as a template rather than a data file: Flax's Eleventy build does not
    pick up new files in data/. -#}
